#~ "10 is binary 1010; and 1100 \"ored\" with 1010 is 1110, which is integer "
#~ "14)."
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "BITOR(12;10) ritoûne 14 (a cåze kel decimå 12 est l' binaire 1100 eyet "
#~ "kel decimå 10 est l' binaire 1010 eyet k' 1100 \"ouwé\" avou 1010 ça dene "
#~ "1110, ki si etir est 14)."

#~ msgid ""
#~ "The BITXOR() function performs a bit-wise exclusive-OR operation for the "
